| Pi PTO permission | 1 | HiLetGo candidate, contact/rating unverified |
| Alta PTO permission | 1 | **CONDITIONAL — not in verified inventory** |
| Pi engine stop | 1 | **CONDITIONAL — form/interface BLOCKED** |
| Alta engine stop | 1 | **CONDITIONAL — form/interface BLOCKED** |
| Starter | 1 | separate function, not allocated |

Two HiLetGo single-channel modules are confirmed and one is intended for steering power. The
automotive harness is **not** verified to contain relay bodies. Toro factory relay 1-643275 is part of
the OEM circuit, not a spare. Software cannot create a switching pole.
